            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Keepsake"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(abjuration, primal)\n\nThe leshy can store an item of light Bulk or less in its head, concealing it as nondetection. If stored for 24 hours, the item benefits from mending."
